# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
.terraform.lock.hcl

# Never commit real tfvars (may contain account IDs, ARNs, image URIs)
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example

# Secrets — NGC_API_KEY must never be committed (see docs/SECURITY.md)
.env
.secrets/
*.pem
*.key

# Editor / OS backups
*~
.DS_Store
*.swp
